# Build sources for shipped assets live in design/ and ARE tracked — see
# design/og-default.svg, which is the only source /og-default.png has.
# Nothing in design/ is copied into the build: publicDir is public/, and
# Astro copies that folder verbatim (a leading _ means nothing there — the
# underscore convention only applies to web/pages/). Anything under public/
# is published, tracked or not.
#
# standalone.html is a local mockup, not a build input — keep it out of git.
design/standalone.html
